---
layout: default
subject: Reset your password
---
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password. The link below is valid for {{expire_hours}} hours and can be used once.</p>
<p style="margin: 28px 0; text-align: center;">
	<a href="{{reset_link}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #1f2937; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Choose a new password</a>
</p>
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; word-break: break-all;">Or open this link: <a href="{{reset_link}}">{{reset_link}}</a></p>
<p>If you did not ask for this, your password is unchanged and no action is needed.</p>
